            "detailed_description": "Puzzle alone, with or against your friends - several artworks from indie-games and artists are available! <br>Beside the singleplayer-mode the game offers several multiplayer-modes. Play a relaxed puzzle together with your friends on Steam or challenge them to exciting matches!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Singleplayer- and different multiplayer-modes (Co-Op and Versus)<br></li><li> 37 fantastic and hand-drawn artworks from different artists and indie-games<br></li><li> Compete with your friends and other players on the Steam Leaderboards<br></li><li> Integrated multiplayer chat-system <br></li><li> Includes Trading-Cards, Achievements and Emoticons!</li></ul> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/620650/extras/872f0b68e0107f99cc0bf89eda22b725.webp?t=1721347948\" width=54 height=54 /></span>",
